<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">6.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">This form of
                                            proxy must be signed by you or your attorney duly authorized in writing. In case of a corporation,
