<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">7.</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Where there
                                            are joint registered holders of any share, any one of such persons may vote at the meeting,
